{
    "title": "Find US medical practices, clinics and healthcare companies by specialty",
    "description": "Pick the kinds of practices and where. The Actor searches the official CMS NPI Registry for organizations (never individual practitioners), splits big searches so nothing is cut off at the registry's 1,200-row limit, merges duplicate NPIs at the same location, and returns one clean list with phone, fax, address, specialties and registration date.",
